// Clue Name :
"P2366560750" "Odd Communication"
// DetailString :
"P2979244211" "You overheard the Council Ascendant speaking to someone over a walkie talkie. You assume by his reverent tone that it was the Center, but the Ascendant referred to a third, unknown party."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ParsonGoneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3691599766" "Alec Parson Kidnapped"
// DetailString :
"P3088571482" "You rescued a scientist named Emil Christie, who told you that Alec Parson was already gone. He believed that you could still catch Silver Mantis and her crew if you hurried.<br><br>Emil Christie also mentioned that he bought a plushie someone made of you. Maybe next time you could autograph it for him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL6_7_Provost_Marchand_Arc_One 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P4165135946" "New Praetorians Plaque"
// tDetailString :
"P2822027152" "You received a plaque dating the founding of the New Praetorians. You remember when you helped Provost Marchand form the supergroup in an experience you call...<br><br><b>A New Dimension, a New Team</b><br><br>Provost Marchand was looking to form the New Praetorians and had a list of people who wanted to join. You went out and recruited/rescued the members of the group - Marauder, Aurora Pena, Alec Parson, Riptide, and Pendragon. Desdemona and Noble Savage were offered positions in the group, but they were unable to join due to their commitment to the Praetorians.<br><br>Provost Marchand gathered the group for the first official meeting, which was interrupted by the Center. He revealed that the Council had staged a massive breakout from the Zig, thanks to the help of Calvin Scott and his loyal Resistance soldiers! The Center made an offer, which was that you and the New Praetorians could either stand aside and let him take over America, or try to fight him and be destroyed.<br><br>The choice of what to do next was obvious - stop the Center and Calvin Scott's plans for taking over the country!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - FlashbackLeft 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marauder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page CleopatraMoralityDead Text :
"P988846622" "You... {HeroName}... some nerve comin' here. I remember you... the one who told me my girl Cleo was in the Resistance, that she was put down. You see everything here? Look at it...<br><br>The girl who I loved was put down because some guy in a white suit said she was the enemy. I shoulda known it wasn't right, shoulda known better.<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum made me into a weakling! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Answer Text :
"P3333345399" "I'm here on behalf of Marchand. We're getting you out, Praetor White."
// Page RegularPraetorian Text :
"P2234058733" "You... {HeroName}... I remember you. Powers Division... hah... so long ago, back when all that mattered.<br><br>Cleo's dead. She died tryin' to protect me, even admitted that she was in the Resistance this entire time. Not that it mattered. She died fightin' off those monsters, while I stood there like some sorta broken dog!<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum made me into a weakling! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Page RegularLambda Text :
"P485682621" "You... {HeroName}... I remember you, back in the fight for Lambda sector. Heh... wish I had some of them War Walkers here right about now. Sure would be helpful.<br><br>My girl's dead. She died tryin' to protect me, even admitted that she was in the Resistance this entire time. Not that it mattered. She died fightin' off those monsters, while I stood there like some sorta broken dog!<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum made me into a weakling! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Page Regular Text :
"P1726664252" "You... {HeroName}... I've heard of you. Read up on your files and all your fightin'.<br><br>My girl's dead. She died tryin' to protect me, even admitted that she was in the Resistance this entire time. Not that it mattered. She died fightin' off those monsters, while I stood there like some sorta broken dog!<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum made me into a weakling! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1823011055" "<color orange>Praetor White wheezes out a laugh.</color><br><br>I ain't Praetor White, I'm just Marauder now. I shoulda known Marchand would still want me, he was always the one arguin' with big bad Marcus.<br><br>I guess I don't got much of a choice, eh? It's either stay here and become one of these Devoured, or go work with Marchand.<br><br>Suppose I could have worse options, then again, I ain't exactly sure that Primal Earth won't just lock me up in a cell.<br><br>Dammit... to fall so far, {HeroName}! Just... slap me with your fancy teleporter and get me outta here. Let me reflect on my situation when I ain't got a Hamidon staring at me like I'm dinner."
// Answer Text :
"P4005774193" "(Teleport Marauder out)"
// Answer Text :
"P1898747308" "I know about what you did in the Mid-West. Why should I trust you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2011051843" "Why should we trust you to help us?"
// Page DestroyersSouvenir Text :
"P1415393258" "Hah... so, you're the one Acid Black talked to. Shoulda known, shoulda known... well, why not? Let's thrash it out here. Yeah, I admit, I did a lotta bad back in the day. People died 'cause of me, people who were too weak to take care of themselves.<br><br>The world that I lived in was Hell, {HeroName}, pure and simple. We were abandoned by <i>everyone</i>. No one wanted to help us, so someone had to be the strong man and take matters into their own hands.<br><br>I sided with Cole 'cause I believed in him and what he was doing. It wasn't until I was together with... together with Cleo that I realized somethin'."
// Answer Text :
"P1514027916" "What did you realize?"
// Page NoSouvenir Text :
"P1520483266" "You got some guts bringin' this up with Hamidon right around the corner. I respect that, so let's do this.<br><br>You know why they called me Marauder? It was 'cause I led a war band in the Mid-West after the Hamidon came knockin' at our door. There were monsters everywhere; me and the boys I rolled with did everything we could to survive; keep the strong, kill the weak. The world that I lived in was Hell, {HeroName}, pure and simple. We were abandoned by <i>everyone</i>. No one wanted to help us, so someone had to be the strong man and take matters into their own hands.<br><br>I sided with Cole 'cause I believed in him and what he was doing. It wasn't until I was together with... together with Cleo that I realized somethin'."
// Page Realization Text :
"P4068479372" "That call I made to kill the weak and take the strong... That was the call of a <i>weak</i> man. I didn't take those people 'cause I was afraid they'd slow us down, that it would mean the end of everyone.<br><br>If I had been <i>stronger</i>, if I had been a better man, I woulda taken those people with us, found a way to make it all <i>work</i>.<br><br>I ain't gonna tell ya what else happened when I came to that realization, 'cause it ain't pretty. But you asked if you could trust me, and I'm tellin' you that you can.<br><br>If I ever get my strength back, I'm gonna use it to protect the weak. That's what I did in Praetoria, and that's what I'm gonna continue to do.<br><br>I'm gonna do it for all those people I killed, for the boys in the Destroyers... and for Cleo."
// Answer Text :
"P777709414" "Fair enough. (Teleport Marauder)"
// Page Done Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Sheridan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1050508140" "{HeroName}, Marchand has briefed me. We've got the portal open for a little longer, but you'll need to hurry.<br><br>It's a huge risk keeping this open in the first place!"
// Answer Text :
"P3883861207" "(Go to Praetoria)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1750174584" "Our first task is to rescue <color yellow>Praetor Michael White</color>. I've had several arguments with members of the Phalanx and Vanguard, but I believe he can be of use. White has done many things in the past, actions that he and I have talked about for a long. I <i>know</i> that he wants to atone for his past, that is why he took the position as head of security for Praetoria. He fought for the good of Praetoria and for what he believed in - we just need him to fight for <i>us</i>.<br><br>Doctor Orts of Vanguard has informed me that they have a location of where Praetor White is, but it isn't good. He's in the outskirts of Imperial City, but he doesn't seem to be moving.<br><br>We need to recover Praetor White before the Devouring Earth find him and make him into one of their own."
// AcceptString :
"P939150519" "Alright, how can I get there?"
// SendOffString :
"P3972816013" "Portal Corp has developed a smaller, more compact portal to use, thanks to the research done by one <color yellow>Emil Christie</color>. <color yellow>Steven Sheridan</color> can help get you to the location; he helped Emil Christie with the development of the new technology.<br><br>I must warn you, {HeroName}, that  you will be going into an <i>extremely</i> dangerous zone. The Hamidon is running rampant there. Vanguard has agreed to send in reinforcements with you, and soldiers loyal to myself have also agreed to provide cover fire for you once you're in.<br><br>Speak with me once you've recovered Praetor White. Marchand out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2385089781" "Rescue Praetor White"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P629633525" "We must act fast, {HeroName}, we can't keep this portal open for long."
// TaskTitle :
"P1858679141" "<color deepskyblue>A New Dimension, a New Team</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P522355530" "<color deepskyblue>Part 1: The Top Dog of Praetoria</color>"

