// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1990131101" "You've recovered Praetor White, although it seems he's not going to be much help to the cause without his powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P762598054" "Good work, {HeroName}. I should've known that Praetor Berry's serum would have adverse effects. The man was an imbecile and bad for Praetoria as a whole. I remember he swore that the serum would last for White. I can only hope that wherever Berry is he is paying for the terrible things he’s done.<br><br>Vanguard is currently holding White in its custody. They want to make sure he really is powerless before releasing him under my care. Even without his powers, White can be a great help to all of us as another tactician. He fought back in the Hamidon Wars and against the Resistance; if there's a battle to be fought, he'll know how to win it.<br><br>Now, {HeroName}, we should move on to our next recruit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Protestor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1396522371" "We're here to protest the Praetorians being locked away like this! Vanguard doesn't have the right to keep them here, it's a prison! What do you say, {HeroName}?!"
// Answer Text :
"P1764598887" "The Praetorians need to be protected, first."
// Answer Text :
"P1245783939" "I'll see what I can do about this situation."
// Answer Text :
"P1845947644" "I don't have time for this at the moment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Desdemona 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3096777406" "{HeroName}. It's always good to see you. Vanguard is taking very good care of the denizens of First Ward, though, as you see, some citizens of Primal Earth aren't very... happy about our situation. However, the people of First Ward are relieved to finally have some peace.<br><br>What can I do for you today?"
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P4013864820" "Vanguard is taking great care of us, {HeroName}, the people of First Ward are finally able to relax. What can I help you with today?"
// Answer Text :
"P3646033872" "(Explain Marchand's New Praetorians)"
// Page NewPraetorians Text :
"P697543852" "Hrm... that's an interesting proposal, but I'm afraid I will have to decline. The people here require my aid, especially after <color yellow>we discovered Calvin Scott's insanity</color>.<br><br>Aurora and Noble Savage may be interested. The two of them, along with some Carnival of Light, were taken on a tour of Paragon City. I'm sure you could ask them when they're back. <br><br>However... there is someone else who may be able to help you."
// Page NewPraetorians SayOutLoudText :
"P1412114754" "Forming the New Praetorians? I'm afraid I can't help you. Aurora and Noble Savage are out right now, but there is someone who can help."
// Answer Text :
"P3424581028" "Who else could help me?"
// Answer Text :
"P3464030053" "Do you know what happened to Calvin Scott?"
// Page CalvinScottFate Text :
"P2583596774" "Unfortunately, I do not. We lost him during the chaos of the Magisterium fight. I know that Vanguard is trying to track him down, as they have reason to believe he still has loyal followers in the Resistance and even a number of turncoats within the Loyalists."
// Page CalvinScottFate SayOutLoudText :
"P1812057662" "We don't know what happened to Calvin Scott. He went missing after the events in the Magisterium."
// Answer Text :
"P2396909767" "I see. Who is this other person who could help me?"
// Page PendragonIncarnate Text :
"P1545027373" "<img align=left src=costume:BK_Pendragon_White width=128 height=128>That would be me, {HeroName}. I never had the chance to apologize about what happened in Night Ward. You... saw me at a low point, as a man who was desperate to prove himself. Now, however, I have seen what I must do, the man who I can be.<br><br>Your New Praetorians group sounds like a noble cause, one that I would be glad to lend my stained sword to, should you allow me.<br><br><color orange>Your communicator lets out several beeps - it's an urgent message from Provost Marchand.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2969927121" "Hold on, Pendragon. Marchand, go ahead."
// Page PendragonNightWard Text :
"P1153865434" "<img align=left src=costume:BK_Pendragon_White width=128 height=128>That would be me, {HeroName}. It has been quite a while since we met in Night Ward. I have seen many things since then, and, as you can see, I have shed my Black Knight armor. I seek to become a true knight now, one that is worthy to be looked up to.<br><br>Your New Praetorians group sounds like a noble cause, one that I would be glad to lend my stained sword to, should you allow me.<br><br><color orange>Your communicator lets out several beeps - it's an urgent message from Provost Marchand.</color>"
// Page PendragonNormal Text :
"P1096408507" "<img align=left src=costume:BK_Pendragon_White width=128 height=128>That would be me, {HeroName}. I am <color yellow>Pendragon</color>, a former member of the <color red>Black Knights</color>. I know that the people here may be biased against Praetorians; I wish to use my abilities to help change that.<br><br>Your New Praetorians group sounds like a noble cause, one that I would be glad to lend my stained sword to, should you allow me.<br><br><color orange>Your communicator lets out several beeps - it's an urgent message from Provost Marchand.</color>"
// Page MarchandGo Text :
"P849922629" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Provost_Marshal_Gerald_T_Marchand width=128 height=128>We have two problems, {HeroName}. The Council have attacked and kidnapped Noble Savage, Aurora Pena, and the Carnival of Light.<br><br>We're also getting readings of a large Devouring Earth presence beneath the Refugee Island. <color yellow>Apex</color> is on his way, but he won't get there in time. We need someone on sight to handle it discreetly; we can't have the people here attacked by <i>our</i> Hamidon.<br><br>Marchand out.<br><br><color orange>You could handle both situations yourself, or you could put Pendragon to the task and have him deal with the Devouring Earth here."
// Answer Text :
"P4215217205" "Pendragon, we have a problem, you're with me."
// Answer Text :
"P2664145733" "Pendragon, there's a situation. I need you to stay here and handle it."
// Answer Text :
"P2854969555" "Stay here, Pendragon. Grant and I need to handle a problem."
// Page EndPageWithPendragon Text :
"P2884756430" "<img align=right src=costume:BK_Pendragon_White width=128 height=128>You have my sword, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P4126636940" "Let's go!"
// Page EndPagePendragonHandles Text :
"P2748848256" "<img align=right src=costume:BK_Pendragon_White width=128 height=128><br><br><color orange>You explain the situation to Pendragon, who nods slightly.</color><br><br>Understood. I've fought the Devouring Earth back in Praetoria, I'll be able to handle things here.<br><br>You take care of Aurora and Noble Savage!"
// Answer Text :
"P2424722671" "Good luck, Pendragon."
// Page EndPageWithoutPendragon Text :
"P3659194503" "<img align=right src=costume:BK_Pendragon_White width=128 height=128><br><br>... Alright, {HeroName}, good luck."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Anna 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Know Text :
"P1389608658" "{HeroName}, it's very good to see you again. Things are going fairly well for us, now that we're out of First Ward.<br><br>I am still considered the leader of the survivors, even during this time. Vanguard spoke with me about this situation and I agreed to it. We could all use some time to rest, and some time to get used to this new world."
// Page Know SayOutLoudText :
"P2497191083" "All the people in First Ward could use some time to rest and get used to this new world."
// Page DontKnow Text :
"P2500976552" "{HeroName}, it's good to meet you, I've heard all about your work here on Primal Earth. I am Anna Palatine, leader of the survivors from First Ward.<br><br>I am still considered the leader of the survivors, even during this time. Vanguard spoke with me about this situation and I agreed to it. We could all use some time to rest, and some time to get used to this new world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Nadia 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Know Text :
"P2434207882" "Ah, greetin's {HeroName}, it's been a long time since I be seein' you. The world of Primal Earth is very different from ours, and yet the same. I can feel great evil here, but a different kind, a <i>magical</i> kind. But I also feel an immense good, altruism, that flows through this world.<br><br>I'm lookin' forward to leavin' this Vanguard base and going out and about, but for now I'll be stayin' here 'till those soldiers give us the okay to head on out. Tons better than it was in First Ward, at least."
// Page Know SayOutLoudText :
"P2069693655" "I'll be stayin' here 'till those soldiers give us the okay to head out. This is tons better than First Ward, at least."
// Page DontKnow Text :
"P29280166" "Ah, greetin's {HeroName}, I've heard all about you. My name's Nadia, member of the Carnival of Light in Praetoria.<br><Br> The world of Primal Earth is very different from ours, and yet the same. I can feel great evil here, but a different kind, a <i>magical</i> kind. But I also feel an immense good, altruism, that flows through this world.<br><br>I'm lookin' forward to leavin' this Vanguard base and going out and about, but for now I'll be stayin' here 'till those soldiers give us the okay to head on out. Tons better than it was in First Ward, at least."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BlindMakwa 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Know Text :
"P3379877363" "Blue skies overhead, the ocean covered by walls of civilization, walls that are hard, built upon good intentions. They are walls that are here to protect and to keep, much like the walls of Praetoria. <br><br>I trust in you though, {HeroName}. You and I have been through much in First Ward. I know that this current situation is not permanent, and that it is done out of... good intentions. Let us just hope the road that is being paved with them leads to a better place."
// Page Know SayOutLoudText :
"P1012855604" "This camp was made with good intentions. I just hope the road that it is paving is not leading to a terrible place once again."
// Page DontKnow Text :
"P310189488" "Blue skies overhead, the ocean covered by walls of civilization, walls that are hard, built upon good intentions. They are walls that are here to protect and to keep, much like the walls of Praetoria. <br><br>I have heard of your heroics, {HeroName}, I trust that you know what you are doing. I know that this current situation is not permanent, and that it is done out of... good intentions. Let us just hope the road that is being paved with them leads to a better place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Katie 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page REALLYKnow Text :
"P22087091" "Hey, {HeroName}. Funny how things turn out, huh? We started all the way back in Imperial City, went through that terrible time in First Ward... then Night Ward... I mean, that was all <i>crazy</i>, right? I don't think either of us could've seen this happen.<br><br>I know that... things have been tough, between the two of us. We both had to do a lot in order to save the day.<br><br>This time here in the island has been... nice, it's given me a chance to reflect on everything. I know I've said some bad things... but I want to say that there's no more animosity between the two of us. Everything turned out for the best, and that's what counts, right?<br><br>I think I'm done with this whole saving the day gig, though. I'm just looking forward to a nice, relaxing rest of my life. Sounds good, doesn't it?"
// Page REALLYKnow SayOutLoudText :
"P2835168236" "We've been through a bit together, {HeroName}, but in the end, it all worked out, huh? I'm looking forward to a long, relaxing vacation."
// Answer Text :
"P1529128089" "You deserve it, Katie. See you around."
// Page Know Text :
"P1231757532" "Hey, {HeroName}, I know that... things have been tough, between the two of us. We both had to do a lot in order to save the day.<br><br>This time here in the island has been... nice, it's given me a chance to reflect on everything. I know I've said some bad things... but I want to say that there's no more animosity between the two of us. Everything turned out for the best, and that's what counts, right?<br><br>I think I'm done with this whole saving the day gig, though. I'm just looking forward to a nice, relaxing rest of my life. Sounds good, doesn't it?"
// Page DontKnow Text :
"P726441185" "You're {HeroName}, right? I'm Katie Douglas. I hope you're not here asking for my help with anything. I've been through <i>enough</i> in Praetoria.<br><br>I'm just looking forward to a nice, relaxing life here in Primal Earth."
// Page DontKnow SayOutLoudText :
"P1352981015" "You're {HeroName}, right? Don't mind me. I'm just sitting here relaxing, and I intend to do that for a -very- long time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MarchandDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3358279969" "Good work out there, {HeroName}. No one on the Refugee Island knew about the Devouring Earth. Gaussian has assured me another Devouring Earth attack will not happen again. In the meantime, I've spoken with Pendragon, and I believe that he'll make a fine addition to the New Praetorians.<br><br>It's a shame about Desdemona, and Noble Savage seems determined to stay with the Forlorn. Aurora, however, is also on board. This is very good, {HeroName}, we already have a strong team."
// Answer Text :
"P3523049410" "What's next?"
// Answer Text :
"P1857883973" "Someone planted those barrels in the island, Marchand."
// Page Next Text :
"P1249802532" "Well, I'm concerned about whom that Council Ascendant was talking to. It's a reminder that what our team is lacking is an expert in technical forensics. Luckily, I know just the man who can help us."
// Answer Text :
"P2901895560" "Who is it?"
// Page Planted Text :
"P1778487009" "Yes, I'm aware of that. I spoke with Gaussian about it, who believes that someone from the outside managed to smuggle those barrels in.<br><br>It's disturbing, to say the least. He's undergoing a full investigation into the matter to see who had contact with moving resources in and out of the island."
// Answer Text :
"P534454708" "Alright, what's next in our plan?"
// Answer Text :
"P3650294025" "The island needs to be shut down. It's too much of a risk."
// Page ShutDownEverything Text :
"P3606933961" "I know your concerns, {HeroName}, I share them as well. The island is only a temporary solution, let me assure you.<br><br>The people of First Ward are used to a very different life, one of war and survival. They need help to be re-integrated back into normal society. This is the help that's being given to them.<br><br>I'm not concerned about what <i>they</i> might do to Primal Earth - I'm concerned about what people on Primal Earth will do to <i>them</i>. You've seen it already - the Council wasted no time in kidnapping the Carnival of Light.<br><br>They need to be prepared for what's out here, and we need to be prepared to protect them properly."
// Answer Text :
"P1905163204" "Fair enough, what's next in our plan?"
// Answer Text :
"P808760702" "If you insist. What's next?"
// Answer Text :
"P1561129656" "Didn't Cole keep people imprisoned for similar reasons?"
// Page Cole Text :
"P3991550927" "...<br><br>I know, {HeroName}, what it seems like. However, we are <i>not</i> walking down that road. The people will be freed soon, Lady Grey has assured me that there is a timeframe for releasing the refugees into Paragon and establishing therapy sessions for them.<br><br>Please, we must turn our attention to finding more members for the New Praetorians. They are exactly the ones who will help with the integration of the Praetorian populace into normal society."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1941006332" "The people of First Ward have been relocated to an island near Paragon City. Vanguard wants to give the people from First Ward time to recuperate and get the help they need, and I agree. These people have been fighting for their lives day in and day out for years. They won't be able to just easily adjust to being in a normal society.<br><br>The Carnival of Light, outside of TUNNEL assistance, have also been relegated to the area until Vanguard can be sure of what will happen if this world's <color yellow>Carnival of Shadows</color> gets near them. Our next possible recruit is on the island, but you won't be going there alone. There is another who is there. He has already agreed to help our cause."
// AcceptString :
"P2067644636" "Who is there at the island? And who is this person helping me?"
// SendOffString :
"P3026966697" "My friend's name is <color yellow>Grant Creston</color>. He was a former commander in the IDF who went rogue to help the people of First Ward. He has agreed to helping our cause by joining the New Praetorians. His experience will help us greatly, and he's no stranger to being seen as an outcast, even to those who he's trying to help.<br><br>Our other recruits are going to be <color yellow>Desdemona</color>, <color yellow>Noble Savage</color>, and <color yellow>Aurora Pena</color>, the former Mother Mayhem. All three are very powerful and will be useful to our cause.<br><br>Desdemona has the psychic power of Vanessa DeVore and her own demon summoning powers and will be eager to help us out. Noble Savage is a dear friend of mine as well; he will no doubt lend his power to our group. Finally, I'm well aware that Aurora has something to prove to the world. Tilman used her body to do terrible things, and Aurora wants to make up for all of it. We're going to give her the chance to do just that.<br><br>Travel to the Refugee Island and speak with Desdemona first. She will know where Noble Savage and Aurora are. "
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2064522162" "<color deepskyblue>Part 2: Refugees</color>"

