// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4177744408" "You rescued Noble Savage!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1026509355" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>No idea, I know all our agents returned from the place."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2624404606" "Do you know what the status is? On Praetoria?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4080093972" "Vandal, Maestro, Nosferatu, Burkholder, AND Arakhn are all locked up. How are we supposed to work without the heads of the Council?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2578465258" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>We still have the Center. I know I believe in him, why don't you?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3297733589" "Did you ever fight those War Walkers? During the invasion?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1721752905" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I did, I sent a full report to the Center the first time I saw them in action. Our technology doesn't come close to those things."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4198787423" "I heard the Center is very interested in Kallisti Wharf, even though it's still under construction."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3166861033" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>It's all just rumors at this point. We can't act on anything."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P741341869" "I still can't believe it, everything that happened in Dark Astoria. Why weren't we ordered to help?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P345805025" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>The Center knew that the assembled could handle it."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3090923751" "What are we planning to do with the Carnival of Light? Wouldn't the Forlorn be more useful to kidnap?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1466167251" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>The Center says we need the Carnival, for now."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1962278135" "Ascendant Archon"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3717738906" "Leave blank to use default info."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1521554869" "Yes sir, we've got her and the others. We picked up the beast, we'll dispose of him."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3712408262" "Sir, we've got hostiles. Let him know the plan has failed."

