// Script Variable ALLY_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1480271779" "Not yet... am I not powerful enough?"
// Script Variable ALLY_RECOVER_DIALOG :
"P1790790530" "<shout>I have too much to prove to be defeated here!"
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P56946997" "This is Arachnos? Let's see what they're made of."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2348750023" "I'm still not used to these Primal Earth groups... why are you all not focusing on the Hamidon?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4110431308" "Desdemona cleansed me of my evil back in Night Ward. However, I still feel something odd, as if... it isn't fully gone."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1177282045" "My brother, Bedwyr, would enjoy this battle! If only he could be here to see us in action."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2401777998" "Arachnos will know to fear the New Praetorians! How many have we defeated now?"
