"P2097708347" "<shout>I'm not done yet, not by a longshot."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3032690705" "They're good fighters, I'll give them that! A little bit above the DUST that I fought back in First Ward."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3692639460" "I think I like Arachnos. There's no grey area when fighting them, at least from what I can see."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2694878915" "Hrm, they're stronger than DUST, but the DUST had plenty more tactics back in First Ward. I remember this one attack on the survivor compound..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2994386669" "I've had this IDF armor forever. It's seen more things than most people in First Ward could imagine."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3873215455" "That's all the scientists, except for Parson..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1436357790" "Red Widow planned this attack perfectly. I'm surprised Black Scorpion was willing to work with her."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3812149657" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I heard she's forming an alliance with him and Mako."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3212656773" "Keep an eye out for that new portal technology. We could use it for Recluse's plans."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1478988904" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Hope it doesn't involve Praetoria. Did you hear what happened to that one operative who went in there? He was devoured by Hamidon!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1101580507" "Something's up with Dr. Aeon ever since Vernon von Grun revealed he cracked the genetic code for the Devouring Earth."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1037364706" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I heard he might defect. Recluse wasn't happy with the amount of resources that Aeon put into that whole Architect program."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4024112044" "Silver Mantis should be long gone by now. What are the orders?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2824736996" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Stay and take down {HeroName}. {Hero.gender=male He|She} has been a pain in our side for far too long."
