// Dialog :
"P2490016991" "You defeated Silver Mantis!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1604718647" "Man! That was... my heart was racing!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2746176581" "<shout>All I have to do is hold you off, Silver Mantis!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1775840316" "Urgh... it's up to you to finish this off...!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3764310626" "We've got confirmation that {HeroName} is on the way."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1510899397" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Then delay {Hero.gender=male him|her}! We've got strict orders, Recluse needs Parson for his new plans."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1890856459" "The amount of new initiatives in foreign technology is massive. Recluse seems more focused than ever."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4050740545" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>You can thank Red Widow for that. Something about her reminded Recluse about the old days, I think."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P997350243" "We should be trying to get Darrin Wade from Vanguard! Doesn't he have all of the knowledge of Rularuu?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2551738281" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I heard Recluse wants to strike a deal with Dream Doctor regarding Rularuu."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P781233453" "Some of the Webmasters were talking about their tour in Dark Astoria. I've never heard stories like that before."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P555598119" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I'm just glad I wasn't chosen to go. I signed up to deal with heroes, not eldritch horrors."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3731496600" "One of the Arbiters looked really out of it. What was his deal?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2434084069" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>He was chosen to use the revamped empowerment machine. I don't think it went very well, especially now that the machine is gone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2981481811" "You've stopped Arachnos from kidnapping Alec Parson!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1538161271" "I knew I could count on you, {HeroName}. Alec Parson has agreed to join the New Praetorians as our technological expert. As you saw, Riptide is our final member.<br><br>He's an honorable soldier who was fighting for a dishonorable man. I've vouched on his behalf to the Paragon authorities and to Vanguard that if he was given a chance, Riptide could show everyone that there <i>were</i> good people within Cole's regime, people who genuinely wanted to help and who believed that innocent Praetorians were at risk.<br><br>Riptide was eager to get out of his cell and put in the people who deserved to be there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3197548038" "Good of you to make it, {HeroName}. You're the heart of this group, for now, until we can get ourselves up to speed. The others would like to say something to you."
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P3667603609" "Thank you for making it, {HeroName}. The others would like to say something to you, now that we're gathered."
// Answer Text :
"P2942583744" "(Listen)"
// Page CleopatraMoralityDead Text :
"P3375425221" "<img align=left src=costume:Signature_Marauder_02_NoRing width=128 height=128>You took out my girl, {HeroName}. That's not somethin' I'm gonna forget. But you were doin' what you thought was right, and I can respect that.<br><br> Things are gonna be different from here on out. We ain't got big bad Marcus pulling our leashes. We're gonna show Primal Earth that there's a new batch of Top Dogs in town!"
// Answer Text :
"P313739561" "(Continue)"
// Page RegularPraetorian Text :
"P3731042920" "<img align=left src=costume:Signature_Marauder_02_NoRing width=128 height=128>I remember when you were just a pup, {HeroName}, brand new in Powers Division. Who woulda guessed that we'd both be here in a different dimension workin' to fight things like the Freakshow?<br><br> Things are gonna be different from here on out. We ain't got big bad Marcus pulling our leashes. We're gonna show Primal Earth that there's a new batch of Top Dogs in town!"
// Page RegularLambda Text :
"P429680560" "<img align=left src=costume:Signature_Marauder_02_NoRing width=128 height=128>You put up a good fight in Lambda, {HeroName}, I'll give ya that. Maybe you and me will spar again, if I ever get my powers back.<br><br> Things are gonna be different from here on out. We ain't got big bad Marcus pulling our leashes. We're gonna show Primal Earth that there's a new batch of Top Dogs in town!"
// Page Regular Text :
"P1736165751" "<img align=left src=costume:Signature_Marauder_02_NoRing width=128 height=128>Things are gonna be different from here on out. We ain't got big bad Marcus pulling our leashes. We're gonna show Primal Earth that there's a new batch of Top Dogs in town!"
// Page Hetzfeld Text :
"P1936165574" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_IDF_Riptide_NoRing width=128 height=128>Remember Hetzfeld, {HeroName}? You and I have seen some very strange things together; Hetzfeld and his experiments were just the beginning.<br><br>I'm going to show Primal Earth that Praetoria had <i>good</i> people serving under Cole. I always wanted to do what was right, what was <i>just</i>. Now, I'm finally getting my chance to do that."
// Page Transmuter Text :
"P1470599736" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_IDF_Riptide_NoRing width=128 height=128>I remember Warrant, {HeroName}. I'll never forget how he died at the hand of Reese. He was a good man, and he'll be missed. Every criminal I bring in will be done in Warrant's name... I know he would've wanted that.<br><br>I'm going to show Primal Earth that Praetoria had <i>good</i> people serving under Cole. I always wanted to do what was right, what was <i>just</i>. Now, I'm finally getting my chance to do that."
// Page TopDog Text :
"P4228172470" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_IDF_Riptide_NoRing width=128 height=128>We've both come a long way since our fight in the Magisterium, haven't we? I only hope that Reese, despite all his flaws, finally changed his ways. If he hasn't, then let's hope he died a very painful death.<br><br>I'm going to show Primal Earth that Praetoria had <i>good</i> people serving under Cole. I always wanted to do what was right, what was <i>just</i>. Now, I'm finally getting my chance to do that."
// Page Sutter Text :
"P4239994005" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_IDF_Riptide_NoRing width=128 height=128>What happened during the attack on Talos was unfortunate, {HeroName}. I was told that what was done <i>had</i> to be done to save Praetoria. However... that does not pardon what happened. I fight now with the memories of that day in my mind.<br><br>I'm going to show Primal Earth that Praetoria had <i>good</i> people serving under Cole. I always wanted to do what was right, what was <i>just</i>. Now, I'm finally getting my chance to do that."
// Page RegularRiptide Text :
"P411935671" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_IDF_Riptide_NoRing width=128 height=128>I'm going to show Primal Earth that Praetoria had <i>good</i> people serving under Cole. I always wanted to do what was right, what was <i>just</i>. Now, I'm finally getting my chance to do that."
// Page MotherMayhemContact Text :
"P3339215418" "<img align=left src=costume:CoL_Signature_AuroraBorealis_NoRing width=128 height=128>{HeroName}. I remember many things from the time that Mother Mayhem had control of my body. I remember her working together with you. I'm... sorry, for all of that. I know it wasn't me, but I feel I need to apologize, anyway. You were trying to help Praetoria... while all she wanted was to take more power from Vanessa DeVore.<br><br>Now that I have my own body back, you can bet that I won't rest until I've made up for the sins of Mother Mayhem. That may mean that I <i>never</i> rest... but if that's the case, then so be it. I was trapped in my own body for long enough. It's time that I take action against those who would seek to use the world for their own agenda!"
// Page MindsofMayhemCheck Text :
"P2226976791" "<img align=left src=costume:CoL_Signature_AuroraBorealis_NoRing width=128 height=128>{HeroName}, thank you, for everything. You risked life and limb to save me from the Seer Network.  It was because of you and your allies that Mother Mayhem's terror was finally destroyed, once and for all.<br><br>Now that I have my own body back, you can bet that I won't rest until I've made up for the sins of Mother Mayhem. That may mean that I <i>never</i> rest... but if that's the case, then so be it. I was trapped in my own body for long enough. It's time that I take action against those who would seek to use the world for their own agenda!"
// Page RegularAurora Text :
"P2087820411" "<img align=left src=costume:CoL_Signature_AuroraBorealis_NoRing width=128 height=128>Now that I have my own body back, you can bet that I won't rest until I've made up for the sins of Mother Mayhem. That may mean that I <i>never</i> rest... but if that's the case, then so be it. I was trapped in my own body for long enough. It's time that I take action against those who would seek to use the world for their own agenda!"
// Page ImperialCityArc Text :
"P2904604852" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Alec_Parson_NoRing width=128 height=128>Whew, {HeroName}! You and I have a habit of running into each other, don't we? I remember when we first worked on the case against Metronome, I mean, Russel Brandt. Who would've guessed that he'd go from madman to an ally in the fight against Cole? Then again, I never would've thought that I'd be working <i>against</i> Cole.<br><br>I've got a few things that I'd like to try while being part of the New Praetorians, {HeroName}. You should see some of the efforts of my technology in action soon; one of them is what I call the RDC. Rapid Deployment Clockwork. Don't worry, you'll see it soon enough!"
// Page IncarnateArc Text :
"P1637305039" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Alec_Parson_NoRing width=128 height=128>It's good to be here in Primal Earth, {HeroName}. I loved Imperial City, but I knew things there wouldn't last very long. You'll be happy to know that IVy is under Vanguard care now. They asked for her after she was reprogrammed to help you in Imperial City.<br><br>I've got a few things that I'd like to try while being part of the New Praetorians, {HeroName}. You should see some of the efforts of my technology in action soon; one of them is what I call the RDC. Rapid Deployment Clockwork. Don't worry, you'll see it soon enough!"
// Page RegularParson Text :
"P2377499793" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Alec_Parson_NoRing width=128 height=128>I've got a few things that I'd like to try while being part of the New Praetorians, {HeroName}. You should see some of the efforts of my technology in action soon; one of them is what I call the RDC. Rapid Deployment Clockwork. Don't worry, you'll see it soon enough!"
// Page CouncilAnnounce Text :
"P701467091" "<color orange>Before Pendragon or Grant Creston can speak, you hear a loud SCREECH from the video monitor behind Provost Marchand. The screen flashes for a few minutes before several figures appear on it...</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P567787898" "(Look at the screen)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P20262110" "We have our team, {HeroName}. Praetor White has been released under my care, though he prefers to be called his old name now: <color yellow>Marauder</color>. He and I will be acting as the tacticians for the team. You, Pendragon, Riptide, Grant, and Aurora will act as our heroes on the ground, while Alec Parson will provide technical support.<br><br>We're going to have our first official group meeting in our base, located within Brickstown. I should warn you, however, the base is somewhat... lackluster."
// AcceptString :
"P2030655774" "Lackluster? Why is that?"
// SendOffString :
"P445062133" "We're still not fully trusted by the authorities here, {HeroName}. They have us on a very short leash. There's fear that there may somehow be a part of Mother Mayhem still in Aurora's mind. Then there's Marauder's past, not to mention Grant and Riptide's status as members of the IDF. The only people who are really trusted are you, Pendragon, and Parson.<br><br>For these reasons, we've been given a very... small base of operations to begin. It'll be enough, however. We'll all meet there to go over what our next move is."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3630523352" "Meet the New Praetorians"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1300851347" "<color orange>Provost Marchand's line is silent.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3479394777" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Formation</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4053008572" "Provost Marchand wasn't kidding. This can hardly even be called a base!"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2841840849" "Speak with Provost Marchand"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P685321034" "Provost Marchand"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2540823895" "This is very bad. Everyone, outside! We must get this situation under control!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3007204151" "We're gonna show Primal Earth that there's a new batch of Top Dogs in town, and we're not gonna take nicely to them causin' chaos."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2850028359" "I've stood by and watched crimes happen for far too long. It's time I use the powers given to me for good."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P466327192" "I owe the people here a debt for my previous actions. I intend to repay that in full and then some."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2362271708" "I'll be getting to work on all sorts of interesting Clockwork for us to use. I can't wait to show off the prototypes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3840975119" "<em explain t=5 d=5>Pardon the rude interruption, but I felt the need to interject."
// 8 Actor1 :
"P1757388790" "<em thanks t=8 d=8>For those who do not know, I am the Center. Leader of the Council. I am here with some... friends of mine."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2609922223" "<t=5 d=5>You may recognize one of them. Calvin Scott."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P114529809" "<em no t=3 d=3>I see you made it to Primal Earth, -Aurora-."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3392298564" "<em laugh t=5 d=5>Let's keep this civil, Calvin. I'll cut to the chase."
// 7 Actor1 :
"P3369699046" "<em lecture t=7 d=7>With the aid of Calvin Scott's Resistance, we have broken out every single prisoner within the Ziggurat."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P738810478" "<t=6 d=6>As we speak, the tunnels beneath Brickstown are swarming with convicts. My request is simple."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3358900227" "<t=5 d=5>Stay out of our way, and when I take over America, I shall ensure you all are well rewarded."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P214047095" "<t=5 d=5>For example, Marauder, my scientists will reverse the effects of Berry's serum on you."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1954536854" "<em thanks t=5 d=5>And {HeroName}... you could make an excellent lieutenant in the Council."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P738507789" "<t=5 d=5>That is all, for now. Stand with me, or be torn down. You've been warned."
